{"version":1,"content":"<p>經濟學家José García Montalvo估算，《GTA6/俠盜獵車6》發售當天可能有多達150萬名美國員工為體驗遊戲而缺勤，生產力下降造成的潛在損失約為10億美元。這項估算以2026年11月19日發售為前提，影響可能更多集中在18至30歲男性和科技行業。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1583252.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:45.072042+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T14:52:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_hash":"98653acdf351f30121e525b30cbe29c2bd90bdc7a88081ac2f054f504104bf7b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}